<SiteLayout title="Micro Expression Trainer Privacy Policy" description="Privacy Policy for Micro Expression Trainer by Kroma Digital.">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow">App Privacy</span><h1>Micro Expression Trainer</h1><p>Privacy Policy for the Micro Expression Trainer Android application.</p></div></section>
<section class="content"><div class="wrap prose"><p><strong>Last updated: September 7, 2026</strong></p><p><span class="tag">Pre-release draft</span></p><h2>1. About this app</h2><p>Micro Expression Trainer is an observation-training Android application developed by Kroma Digital.</p><h2>2. Account and personal information</h2><p>The planned application does not require account registration. Training uses app-provided facial-expression images and does not require the user to identify or upload another person.</p><h2>3. Training data</h2><p>Scores, progress, settings, or similar training information may be stored locally on the user's device. Final storage behavior will be verified before release.</p><h2>4. Camera, photos and biometric data</h2><p>The planned core training experience does not require camera access, user photos, face recognition, or biometric identification. If this changes before release, this policy and the Google Play Data safety declaration will be updated before publication.</p><h2>5. Third-party services</h2><p>Any analytics, advertising, billing, crash reporting, or other third-party SDKs included in the release will be disclosed here where required.</p><h2>6. Changes</h2><p>This draft will be finalized after the released app's permissions, SDKs, storage behavior, and data practices are verified.</p><h2>7. Contact</h2><p>Privacy questions can be sent through the Kroma Digital <a href="/contact">Contact page</a>.</p></div></section>
</SiteLayout>